---
layout: base.njk
title: The Trip – Pom and Paddy
description: Route plan and statistics from Dean and Orla's 2004 road trip around Australia.
permalink: /trip/
---
<main>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>The Trip</h1>
  <p class="lede">The plan of attack, and some (not so vital) statistics.</p>

  <h2 id="plan">Plan of attack</h2>
  <p>Sydney to Sydney, anticlockwise, 28 March to 20 June 2004 &mdash; roughly {{ route | legTotal }} km as planned.</p>
  <div class="table-scroll">
  <table class="data plan">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Leg</th><th scope="col">km</th><th scope="col">Duration</th><th scope="col">Start</th><th scope="col">Finish</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
{%- for r in route %}
      <tr{% if r.leg %} class="leg"{% endif %}><th scope="row">{{ r.name }}</th><td>{{ r.km | km }}</td><td>{{ r.duration }}</td><td>{{ r.start }}</td><td>{{ r.finish }}</td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="stats">Stats!</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll">
  <table class="data stats">
    <thead><tr>{% for h in stats.headers %}<th scope="col">{{ h }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead>
    <tbody>
{%- for row in stats.rows %}
      <tr><th scope="row">{{ row[0] }}</th><td>{{ row[1] }}</td><td>{{ row[2] }}</td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
</div>
</main>
